msgid ""
"If this box is checked and you uninstall PDF Ink Lite, all your settings "
"will be deleted from your Wordpress database."
msgstr ""
"Si esta casilla está marcada, si/cuando desinstale PDF Ink Lite, todos sus "
"ajustes se borrarán de su base de datos de Wordpress."

